[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057842313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108468#issuecomment-3057842313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108468","id":3057842313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62QviJ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T15:03:17Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T15:03:17Z","body":"This creates a pretty big discrepancy between Android and all the other platforms, and we'd need to evaluate what impact this change might have to CI, both positive and negative, this might hide some bugs that are release specific that we'd otherwise catch\r\n\r\nI'd say that we might want to have this change in general, but if the gradle build fails without a debug build that sounds more like an issue with the export setup, and not the CI situation IMO\r\n\r\nThe debug artifacts and cache entries are also larger","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issue